sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer / AI Agent
    participant API as API Server (App Service)
    participant Client as RunnerClient
    participant Runner as Runner Service (Linux VM)
    participant Docker as Docker / gVisor Engine
    participant Sandbox as Isolated Task Container

    Dev->>API: Execute Plan / Run Tests (task_id)
    API->>Client: execute_command(task_id, cmd, args)
    Client->>Runner: POST /internal/v1/workspaces/{task_id}/exec<br/>(Bearer Token, command, args)
    Runner->>Runner: Validate command allowlist & argument tokens
    Runner->>Docker: docker run / exec with security profile<br/>(--network=none, --read-only, --user 10001)
    Docker->>Sandbox: Execute command in /workspace
    Sandbox-->>Docker: Output / Exit Code
    Docker-->>Runner: Execution Stream (bounded to 100 KB)
    Runner->>Runner: Redact secrets, parse metrics & duration
    Runner-->>Client: 200 OK (WorkspaceCommandResult)
    Client-->>API: Command Result
    API-->>Dev: Verified Results
